    "severity": "high",
    "description": "LLM tasks 'jiminy.codegen' (58.9% error rate) and 'jiminy.synthesize' (60% error rate) have consistently high error rates across the reporting window. This trend is mirrored in low codegen training readiness (high error counts, low responses) and slow progress for synthesis training.",
    "recommended_action": "review_guidance_effectiveness",
    "reasoning": "The exceptionally high error rates for codegen and synthesize tasks contrast with low error rates in other core LLM actions. This persistent problem is not surfaced by general memory/edge health, nor is it immediately reflected in overall success rate due to low task volume. Reviewing guidance effectiveness will help identify whether prompt, constraint, or LLM calibration issues are preventing effective completions for these code-related tasks."
